WEBVTT

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:05.330
Taito...

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.820
Make love to me...

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.590
Who are you?

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.320
Is this another one 
of Ba'alskra's traps?

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.980
Ba'alskra?

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.380
He was such a pitiful child.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.020
I am magic.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:34.530
One of Saitohimea's spells.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.280
Magic?

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:43.590
Saitohimea was so, so lonely 
that she almost had a breakdown.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.610
That was when she created

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.610
the spell,

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.030
Rapture.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.140
Huh? When did I get here?

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:37.480
Again... Why am I crying?

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:41.100
That's not good. It's not normal...

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.670
To periodically lose your memory.

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.750
"And the Seraphim is Sung"

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.900
Gekkou! Gekkou! What's 
that?! What's that?!

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.770
You are the present crow.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.670
Crow? No.

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:03.420
I'm a genius.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.470
Are you the one who summoned me here?

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:11.520
The present crow is 
quite the arrogant one.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.770
You are...

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.480
Ah.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.660
The left head of the crow.

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:21.470
I'm the one asking questions here!

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:24.570
The red moon weeps.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.400
The broken witch weeps.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.770
The crow weeps.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.390
The darkened right head cries.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:38.560
Now, how do you sound when you cry?

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.740
I said to answer my question!

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.690
Curse that thing, Spell Error!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.590
Spell Error isn't working?

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.070
Huh? What's wrong? What? What?

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:02.520
Are we in trouble?!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.400
Shut up!

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.000
Don't tell me to shut up—

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.520
Who are you?

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.540
Seraphim.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.710
Haruka?

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.460
What are you doing?

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.930
I was going to do some shopping.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.320
What's this?

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.070
A list of ingredients for lunch?

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.790
You're making lunch for 
Kurogane again tomorrow?

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:37.770
I hope he eats it, I guess...

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.770
Curse you, Kurogane...

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.640
Running into the arms 
of a transfer student

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:43.430
when you have this angel 
as a childhood friend...

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:44.810
We can't let him get away with this!

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:48.360
Still, that transfer 
student is a total doll.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.610
Hey!

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:54.260
Haruka, you don't have time to mope!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.580
You can beat her tomorrow!

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.000
Let's go!

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.650
Take down the transfer student!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.020
Take her down!

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:02.960
W-Wait!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.060
Taito...

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:09.280
I'll show you what to do...

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:12.160
Wait... Himea?

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:15.230
You will never feel lonely again...

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:18.260
You will never feel scared again...

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.340
Wait, stop!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.760
The world will be ending very soon.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.260
The Seraphim have come.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.310
Se-Seraphim?!

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:35.520
Don't look.

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:38.750
Now, let's begin.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.580
The world will end

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.430
in rapture...

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.060
Seraphim, you said?

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:13.310
The mere sight of my true form

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:16.780
would obliterate your being.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:23.570
I have assumed a form that conforms 
to your limited understanding.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.520
Are you trying to scare 
me into submission?

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:33.910
Crow, the prophecy has 
been put into play.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:36.410
Prophecy?

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.140
Gekkou! That's our school!

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:46.780
Our school!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.580
Student Council

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:00.590
Romance of the Three Kingdoms (Anime) 
 Compendium

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.560
My Three Kingdoms!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.770
I just bought that!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.400
Stop, you fool!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.860
I'm getting revenge!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.690
Don't make me worry, trash.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:29.470
What? You were worried about me?

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.510
That was mean, Gekkou!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.050
So?

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:39.270
Why are the almighty Seraphim putting 
on this grand display of power?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.130
What exactly are your intentions?

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.210
Indeed.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:47.120
The present crow is a 
fascinating creature.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:51.110
This may affect the prophecy...

00:07:52.900 --> 00:08:00.100
Crow. The ancient witch... 
Ramiel Lilith will soon appear.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:03.160
Ramiel Lilith?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:08.710
To destroy the world... 
And to destroy herself.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.240
An abomination.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:17.840
Seraphim?

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.230
Gods from beyond the moon.

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:22.520
They've come to devour Saitohimea.

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:33.110
Now, Taito.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:37.260
Make love to me.

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:41.160
Say, Haruka. What does Kurogane like?

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.350
Probably meat.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:47.890
Fried chicken, pork 
cutlets... And croquettes.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:51.800
Okay! Don't forget the 
potato chips and pudding!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.360
That's what you like.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.830
Taito likes pudding.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:59.280
Put it all in!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.500
The key is to make what he'd like!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:04.890
Let's just stuff a lunch 
with all of his favorites!

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.550
Croquette (Beef)

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:17.030
I hope this makes Taito happy.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.240
Himea! Snap out of it!

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:32.350
I don't get any of this magic stuff,

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:35.420
but if you made this spell, you 
should be able to get rid of it!

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:39.480
She wished me into existence.

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:43.890
She was always alone, 
lonely, sad, suffering...

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.780
Himea...

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.870
Himea!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.200
Himea!

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.130
Himea!

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:21.010
Himea!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.530
Hold on! Himea!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.200
I swore to protect her...

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.960
Confirming that the victim is safe.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.880
Initiating self-restoration.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.440
Restarting Rapture.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.170
You're...

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:53.090
Give back the real Himea!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.040
Give me back the normal Himea!

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:00.220
Do you have the right 
to make that demand?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:05.260
You have no idea what true love is.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:11.280
The truth is that you're attracted 
to her beautiful appearance.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:14.510
You're letting your lust 
cloud your judgment.

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:17.700
Don't be ridiculous! What do you know?!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:23.370
Then explain why Himea 
is always so anxious,

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.360
always so afraid of being alone?

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:27.410
Anxious?

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:29.490
Who is this...

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:30.710
...Haruka-chan?

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.420
Despicable.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:40.020
Poor Himea.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:42.930
You won't be able to break this spell.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:50.850
Let me go!

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:54.270
Rapture upon the world.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.370
Is this witch Saitohimea?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:03.050
The witch was broken by her solitude.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:06.840
She is certain to attack you

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:09.760
and destroy this world.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.660
As the prophecy ordains.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.880
The prophecy...

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:17.540
In other words, Saitohimea 
will destroy this world.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.830
Not Saitohimea.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:22.160
Ramiel Lilith.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.190
The ancient witch.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:27.520
An Other God who desecrates planets.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.500
So, what do you want me to do?

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:34.100
We will lend you our power, crow.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.450
We will grant you the power

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:42.440
to kill Ramiel Lilith 
when the time comes.

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:46.090
You want me to kill Saitohimea.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:56.250
I refuse.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:06.860
You will return here, seeking my power.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:11.230
The witch remains broken, 
and the world will shatter.

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:13.280
As the prophecy ordains.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:15.300
I see.

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:17.470
You're scared.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:19.650
Of Ramiel Lilith.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:31.560
Ge-Gekkou! This doesn't look good!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:36.610
That's why you're depending 
on a genius like me.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:42.000
Honestly, you scumbags always 
give me more work to do.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:49.680
I'll grant your wish.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.680
Deal struck.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.820
Himea!

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:03.020
I'm the reason you broke down?

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:08.240
Himea? Was it my fault for 
never making my feelings clear?

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.360
Your tears had been

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:12.800
replaced by smiles.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:16.120
I was so happy to see you smile.

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:19.530
That was all I needed...

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.590
And yet...

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:36.320
I took away your smile.

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.060
It's okay.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.270
Stop blaming yourself, Taito.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.850
You're not Himea.

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.600
You're wrong, Taito.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:47.820
I'm...

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:51.100
I don't want to see you smile.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:56.970
Himea... I'm a thoughtless, 
worthless fool.

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.850
But I want to see you smile.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.680
Please, Himea.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.920
Smile for me.

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:12.430
I love your smile.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.310
Himea...

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.810
Taito...

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:26.230
Sorry, Taito...

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:27.820
Himea.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.160
It's all my fault...

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:34.600
For getting you involved...

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:37.700
Taito...

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:44.430
It's not important.

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:47.980
I'm the one who should apologize 
for making you uneasy.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.520
Taito...

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:55.620
Error. Confirming resistance 
from the Saitohimea persona.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:57.700
Quarantining process.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:58.850
Restart.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.770
Tai...

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:09.270
Saitohimea's true wish is 
for rapture upon this world.

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:10.610
Rapture.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.690
Rapture.

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.920
Himea! I promise to protect you!

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:19.950
I won't let you ever feel lonely again!

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:26.500
The victim, Kurogane Taito, cannot 
bring rapture upon Saitohimea.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.920
Cannot ease her anxiety.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.320
But Taito is still

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:32.000
the one I...

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:37.140
Reinitiating first stage of Rapture.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:41.680
If the Seraphim want to devour Himea,

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.500
I'll deal with them!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:49.270
I'll protect you from 
Ba'alskra, this funky spell,

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.410
and everything else out there!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.920
I will never abandon you!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.140
Never forget you!

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.420
Rapture upon you.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:03.310
Rapture. Rapture.

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:06.490
We don't need any rapture!

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:09.990
I'm the one who can make Himea smile!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.010
Taito...

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:23.930
It's okay.

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:26.820
Taito...

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:28.840
I...

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.780
I'll always be by your side.

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:58.050
Taito...

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.420
Taito...

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.570
Sorry about leaving you alone.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:06.450
No, I'm also sorry...

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:34.340
Himea-chan and the immortal 
guy are kissing?!

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:40.250
What do you think you're 
doing on school property?

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.260
Wh-What are we doing?

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:45.580
W-Wait! What have you been doing?!

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:49.400
We had it bad! These 
Seraphim things showed up!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.600
I've already dealt with the Seraphim.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.000
Don't tell me that...

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:57.530
You struck a deal with the Seraphim?

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.070
It's none of your business, slaves.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.430
Don't fool around.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:03.660
I can't trust someone who's 
dealing with Seraphim!

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:08.970
Wh-What do you think you're doing?!

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.960
Mirai! Stop that idiot!

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.650
Why?! Why?!

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.570
Y-You...

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:22.300
Saitohimea. Have you heard the 
words Ramiel Lilith before?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:26.050
Ramiel Lilith...?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.480
What's that?

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.620
Some kind of curse?

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:36.900
You're trying to bind me?

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.200
Himea!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.560
If you don't know anything 
about Ramiel Lilith,

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:51.890
the Seraphim no longer 
have any interest in you.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.920
What? That's impossible...

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:58.130
It's up to you to decide 
if you want to believe me.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:03.010
The deal was that the Seraphim would 
agree to never attack my slaves again.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.160
Show some gratitude.

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.250
No way...

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:07.470
Guess what?

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.890
Gekkou was super cool back there!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:12.910
When the Seraphim told 
him to kill Himea-chan...

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:13.950
Silence, slave!

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.610
I'm not like that second-rate 
brother of mine.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.810
I don't betray my allies.

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:19.480
So cool!

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:24.070
Time for some punishment.

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:06.100
The Rapture spell was 
one of my past sins...

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:09.060
It was sealed away with Ba'alskra.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:13.280
But I chose to live my life with you,

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:17.980
so when Ba'alskra died, 
the spell was restored.

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:22.830
And then I let it control 
my body... Sad, isn't it?

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:30.710
Then explain why Himea 
is always so anxious,

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:32.800
always so afraid of being alone?

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.090
You're amazing, Taito.

00:22:40.320 --> 00:22:44.200
I would have given up a long time ago.

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:49.200
But you chased away the 
Seraphim and Rapture for me.

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:52.550
I didn't do anything.

00:22:53.090 --> 00:22:56.560
Gekkou was the one who 
got rid of the Seraphim.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.470
No, it was you.

00:22:59.720 --> 00:23:01.840
If it wasn't for you,

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:04.490
I wouldn't be here now.

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:06.270
Himea...

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:09.300
You always make my heart skip.

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:15.950
Kurenai

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:19.140
Bu-chan-man is about to start!

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:25.340
Saitohimea didn't recognize 
the name Ramiel Lilith.

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:30.260
The witch was broken by her solitude.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:33.810
She is certain to attack you

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:36.700
and destroy this world.

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:38.970
As the prophecy ordains.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.160
The prophecy...

00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:58.950
The monsters from beyond the 
moon are quite cruel, it seems.

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:13.210
Hello, I am the right head of the crow.

00:24:13.210 --> 00:24:14.300
Excuse me.

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:15.730
I meant to say that I am Kurenai Hinata.

00:24:15.730 --> 00:24:20.080
The Seraphim allege that I am to have 
fallen into darkness and cry a lot.

00:24:20.080 --> 00:24:22.230
Well, personally,

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:26.770
the opinion of a needlessly 
large bag of hot air

00:24:26.770 --> 00:24:29.100
can be safely ignored.

00:24:29.420 --> 00:24:32.540
By the way, have you ever 
been on a date before?

00:24:32.540 --> 00:24:34.450
I haven't, of course.

00:24:34.450 --> 00:24:37.550
Well, I should have no difficulty 
in finding someone to accompany me.

00:24:35.110 --> 00:24:39.980
Next Time "(Extracurricular) Activities While Passing Each Other By"
